1. e4 { https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zjt_Hh5L5vg&list=PLQKBpQZcRycrdFv_RC9rovYN1Wh6F_JPR&index=6 } 1... d6 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. f4 Bg7 { [%csl Gf3][%cal Gg1f3,Gf1d3,Ge4e5] } 5. Nf3 (5. e5 dxe5 { [%cal Gf6d7] } 6. fxe5 (6. dxe5 Qxd1+ { [%cal Gc3d1,Gf6d5] } 7. Kxd1 (7. Nxd1 Nd5) 7... Nfd7 8. Nd5 Kd8 { [%csl Gc7] } 9. Nf3 c6 10. Nc3) 6... Nd5 { [%cal Gd8d5] } 7. Ne4 (7. Nxd5 Qxd5 8. c4 Qe4+ 9. Be2 c5) 7... Nb4 8. a3 (8. c3 Bf5 9. Ng3 Nc2+) 8... Qxd4 9. Qxd4 Nxc2+) 5... c5 6. dxc5 (6. Bb5+ Bd7 7. Bxd7+ (7. e5 Ng4 8. e6 (8. Ng5) (8. h3) (8. Bxd7+) 8... fxe6 (8... Bxb5 { This move prevents a forced draw by going into a (theoretically heavy) variation. } 9. exf7+ Kd7) 9. Ng5 Bxb5 10. Nxe6 { [%cal Ge6g7,Ge6d8] } (10. Nxb5) 10... Bxd4 11. Nxd8 Bf2+ 12. Kd2 Be3+ 13. Ke1 Bf2+ 14. Kd2 Be3+ 15. Ke1 Bf2+) 7... Nfxd7 8. d5 b5 9. Nxb5 Qa5+ { [%cal Gb5c3,Gg7c3] }) (6. d5) (6. e5 Nfd7 7. exd6 (7. e6) (7. dxc5) (7. Bc4) (7. Ng5) 7... O-O) 6... Qa5 7. Bd3 (7. cxd6 Nxe4 8. dxe7 Nxc3 9. bxc3 Qxc3+ 10. Kf2 Nc6 { [%cal Gc6d8,Gc6e7] }) 7... Qxc5 { [%cal Gc5g1] } 8. Qe2 { [%cal Ge8g8,Gc1e3,Gc5a5,Gc8g4,Gb8c6] } 8... Bg4 { [%csl Gg4][%cal Gh2h3,Gf3e5,Gf3d4] } 9. Be3 Qa5 10. O-O O-O { [%csl Gg4] } 11. h3 Bxf3 12. Qxf3 Nc6 { [%cal Ge7e6,Ga8c8] } *


