1. e4 { https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wk4VO6I3akk&list=PLQKBpQZcRycrdFv_RC9rovYN1Wh6F_JPR&index=11 } 1... d6 { [%csl Gd4] } 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. Bg5 Bg7 { Queen's side is going to be weaker. We are going to expand here. } 5. e5 (5. Qd2 { [%cal Gg5h6,Gf2f3,Gg2g4,Gh2h4,Ge1c1] } 5... c6 { [%cal Gf2f4,Ge1c1,Gg1f3] } 6. f4 O-O { Very similar to the variation which starts with f4 instead of Qd2. } 7. Bd3 b5 { [%cal Gb5b4] } 8. Nf3 (8. e5 b4 9. Nce2 (9. exf6 bxc3 10. Qxc3 exf6 { [%cal Gf8e8] }) 9... Nd5) (8. a3 h6 9. Bh4 e5 { When they do relatively nothing dangerous. You kick out the bishop and break on e5. } { [%cal Ga7a5,Gb5b4] }) 8... Bg4 9. O-O Qb6 10. Ne2 c5 { [%cal Gc5c4] } 11. e5 { [%cal Gd3e4,Ge5f6] } 11... d5 12. c3 { [%cal Gd3b1] } (12. exf6 exf6 13. Bh4 c4) 12... Ne4 13. Qe3 cxd4 14. cxd4 Nxg5 15. fxg5 Bxf3 16. Rxf3 Nc6 { [%cal Ga8e8,Gf7f6,Gc6b4] }) (5. f4 c6 { [%csl Gf3][%cal Gb7b5,Ga7a4,Gc8g4] } 6. Nf3 Bg4) 5... dxe5 (5... Nfd7 6. f4 (6. exd6 cxd6 { [%cal Ge8g8] } 7. Nf3 (7. Qd2 { [%cal Gd7f6,Ge1c1,Ga8c8,Gc8c1] } 7... Nf6 8. O-O-O O-O { [%cal Gd8a5,Gb8c6] }) 7... O-O 8. Be2 Nf6 9. O-O) 6... O-O 7. Bc4 Nc6 { [%csl Gc4][%cal Ge5e6] } 8. Nf3 (8. e6 Nb6 9. exf7+ { [%cal Gc4b3,Gc6a5] } (9. Bb3 Nxd4) 9... Kh8 { [%csl Gc4,Gf7] } 10. Bb3 Nxd4) 8... Nb6 9. Bb3 Na5 10. O-O Nxb3 11. axb3 f6 12. exf6 exf6 13. Bh4 { [%csl Gh4][%cal Gf6f5,Gg7a1] } 13... d5 14. Ne1 c6 15. Nd3 Qc7 16. Kh1 Bf5 { [%cal Gf5d3] } 17. Nc5 { [%cal Gh7h5,Gh5g4] }) 6. dxe5 { [%cal Gd8d1] } 6... Ng4 { Don't take the Queen instead! This runs unto a mistake. } { [%cal Gg4f2,Gg4e5] } 7. Qxd8+ Kxd8 { [%cal Gg4f2,Gg4e5] } 8. Nd5 { [%csl Gg5][%cal Gd5e7,Gg5e7,Gg4e5,Gg7e5] } (8. Rd1+ Bd7 { The right solution for problems on this file. } 9. e6 fxe6 { [%csl Ge7,Ge6] } 10. Bc4 { [%cal Gd1d8,Gc4e6] } 10... Ke8 11. Nf3 Nc6 12. O-O Nge5 13. Nxe5 Nxe5 14. Bb3 Nf7 15. Bf4 Nd6 16. Rfe1 Bxc3 17. bxc3 Rf8 18. Bg3 Rd8 19. Bxe6 Bxe6 20. Rxe6 Nf5 21. Rxd8+ Kxd8 { This is looking towards a draw. Another variation (moving the knight back) is promising. }) 8... Nc6 { [%csl Ge5][%cal Gc6e7,Gd8e7] } 9. Rd1 Bd7 10. f4 { Visualizing the options starting with f6. } { [%cal Gf7f6,Ge5f6,Ge7f6,Gh8e8,Ge8e1,Gg4e3,Ge3f1,Ge3d1,Ge3c2,Ge3g2,Gd8e8,Gd8c8] } 10... f6 (10... h6 11. Bh4 g5 12. fxg5 hxg5 13. Bxg5) *


