1. e4 { https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZZknJgfOpS4&list=PLQKBpQZcRycrdFv_RC9rovYN1Wh6F_JPR&index=12 } 1... d6 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. g3 Bg7 5. Bg2 O-O 6. Nge2 (6. Nf3 Bg4 { [%cal Gb8c6,Ge7e5] }) 6... e5 { Strike in the center early to prevent complications. As always you want to break on e5. } 7. h3 (7. O-O Nc6) 7... Nc6 8. Be3 exd4 9. Nxd4 { [%cal Gc8d7,Gf8e8] } 9... Bd7 { Don't take the knight as the bishop's position will improve drastically. } 10. O-O Re8 { Development from the opening is completed. Some plans: } { [%csl Gf2] } 11. f4 (11. Re1 Nxd4 12. Bxd4 c5 (12... Qc8 { [%cal Gd7h3] }) 13. Be3 Bc6 { [%cal Gf6e4,Gc6e4,Ge8e4,Gb7b5,Ga7a4] }) 11... Nxe4 12. Nxe4 d5 *


